-- ako/mxcli#1821: `check --references` resolved the target document of alter
-- entity and alter page only. Each statement below names a document that does
-- not exist; exec refuses every one ("microflow not found", …), and check now
-- reports each in the alter entity style, with what the module does have:
--   microflow not found: BugTest1821.NoSuchFlow (referenced by drop microflow) — BugTest1821 has …
-- Run against a project with a BugTest1821 module: every statement is reported.
-- `drop … if exists`, a document the script creates first, and one an earlier
-- rename or move lands under the name are not reported.
mdl 1;
drop microflow BugTest1821.NoSuchFlow;
drop page BugTest1821.NoSuchPage;
drop entity BugTest1821.NoSuchEntity;
drop enumeration BugTest1821.NoSuchEnum;
drop association BugTest1821.NoSuchAssoc;
rename microflow BugTest1821.NoSuchFlow to Other;
move microflow BugTest1821.NoSuchFlow to folder 'X';
alter enumeration BugTest1821.NoSuchEnum add value V caption 'V';
alter microflow BugTest1821.NoSuchFlow { drop $X; };
drop microflow if exists BugTest1821.NoSuchFlow;
